     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi R Users,<div><br></div><div>Welcome back to Spring Term! We are starting up D-RUG meetings again this term, and hope to see you all there. This week, we will be meeting on Tuesday, March 30th from 10-12PDT (zoom link below). However, starting next week we will be meeting on Monday mornings from 10-12 PDT. </div><div><br></div><div>To clarify, we will be hosting a virtual workgroup: </div><div><br></div><div>Tuesday, March 30th 10-12PDT</div><div>Monday, April 5th 10-12 PDT</div><div>Monday, April 13th 10-12PDT</div><div>...etc. every Monday until the end of term. </div><div><br></div><div>Zoom link for Tuesday (3/30) meeting: <a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/91815239430?pwd=eTlpQ1AremNhQkxkNDM1Y2luV2dLdz09\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(14,113,235);text-decoration-line:none;font-family:Lato,Helvetica,Arial;font-size:14px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/91815239430?pwd%3DeTlpQ1AremNhQkxkNDM1Y2luV2dLdz09&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465243899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0uu1bY8X66KwmqFvkmJL1F\">https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/91815239430?pwd=eTlpQ1AremNhQkxkNDM1Y2luV2dLdz09</a></div><div><br></div><div>Finally, if you cannot make it to our meetings this term, remember that you can always post any questions to our awesome <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465243899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wD_B50_HJZ_vKDhgKBcEI\">discourse site</a>. </div><div><br></div><div>Cheers!</div><div>D-RUG Coo[R]dinators </div><div><div><br></div><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><d